at I think boy needs to be injected into this more abundant party more than ever. So I am just going to jump on in and introduce our guest for today's podcast. All right. So we are going to get to our guests. We're very excited. Congresswoman Alexandra Ocasio-Cortez. Welcome. You are the Congresswoman for New York's 14th district, the fighting 14th.",
