    "turn_text": "Yeah. And not only that, but the other thing that makes it dangerous is that it makes us remarkably predictable. It makes the democratic party highly predictable in the decisions it's going to make in the people that we're going to select in the type of people we advance in the way that we make decisions. And when we are highly predictable to the opposition, they will be one, two, four steps ahead. They know what Democrats are going to do.",
