        "text": "The Build Back Better Act failed in the Energy and Commerce Committee by one or two votes.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Legislative progress is gradually eroded due to procedural constraints and narrow margins.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Supporting Democratic majorities is important, but the specific type of Democrat matters more.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Despite low overall approval ratings, many constituents still favor their individual members of Congress.",
